      <![CDATA[<h1 id="今日总结：2026-05-05"><a href="#今日总结：2026-05-05" class="headerlink" title="今日总结：2026-05-05"></a>今日总结：2026-05-05</h1><h2 id="完成项"><a href="#完成项" class="headerlink" title="完成项"></a>完成项</h2><h3 id="1-博客部署问题修复"><a href="#1-博客部署问题修复" class="headerlink" title="1. 博客部署问题修复"></a>1. 博客部署问题修复</h3><p><strong>问题诊断：</strong></p><ol><li><code>package.json</code> 缺少 <code>hexo</code> 字段，导致 hexo-cli 无法正确识别项目</li><li><code>_config.yml</code> 中 <code>message: Site updated: YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss</code> 缺少引号，YAML 解析失败</li><li>缺少 <code>hexo-renderer-marked</code> 渲染器，markdown 文件无法生成 HTML</li><li><code>.deploy_git</code> 子模块损坏</li></ol><p><strong>解决方案：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1. package.json 添加 hexo 字段</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">&quot;hexo&quot;</span>: &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">&quot;version&quot;</span>: <span class="string">&quot;8.1.1&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 2. _config.yml 修复 message 引号</span></span><br><span class="line">message: <span class="string">&quot;Site updated: YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 3. 安装渲染器</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-renderer-marked --save</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 4. 删除损坏的部署目录后重新部署</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">rm</span> -rf .deploy_git</span><br><span class="line">hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>根因分析：</strong></p><ul><li>之前一直通过 <code>node -e &quot;require(&#39;./node_modules/hexo-cli/dist/hexo.js&#39;)()&quot;</code> 手动调用能部分工作，是因为直接加载了 CLI 模块，但 find_pkg 找不到 hexo 字段导致无法加载正确的 hexo 实例</li><li>渲染器缺失导致 posts 被 processed 但没有生成 HTML 文件</li></ul><hr><h2 id="明日计划"><a href="#明日计划" class="headerlink" title="明日计划"></a>明日计划</h2><ol><li>继续 TalentsAI 进阶规划题目练习</li><li>博客日常维护</li></ol><hr><h2 id="仓库信息"><a href="#仓库信息" class="headerlink" title="仓库信息"></a>仓库信息</h2><ul><li>博客仓库：<a href="https://github.com/raojiacui/raojiacui.github.io">https://github.com/raojiacui/raojiacui.github.io</a></li><li>本地路径：<code>C:\Users\雨下雨停\hexo-blog</code></li><li>博客地址：<a href="https://raojiacui.github.io/">https://raojiacui.github.io</a></li></ul>]]>
    </content>
